    <task id="Id_9987d636-7bb8-4b8b-be69-d3d6218881ec" name="5.7.4 b) Verificação reprovada">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Revis&amp;atilde;o n&amp;atilde;o for bem-sucedida&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. a contratante deve rejeitar o modelo de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e instruir a contratada para alterar a informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e ressubmet&amp;ecirc;-lo para aceita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da contratante&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
